294
00:19:53,950 --> 00:19:56,580
Those people seem to have been affected by the attack.

295
00:19:56,620 --> 00:19:58,040
What the hell?

296
00:20:24,120 --> 00:20:25,160
What the fuck?

297
00:20:47,410 --> 00:20:48,540
What the hell is this?

298
00:21:18,660 --> 00:21:20,790
What are those freaks doing?

299
00:21:26,660 --> 00:21:28,540
Turn off the light

300
00:22:10,500 --> 00:22:12,290
What about those students?

301
00:22:12,450 --> 00:22:14,160
Do something, you're a policeman!

302
00:22:14,250 --> 00:22:15,700
We're not safe here, either.

303
00:22:15,750 --> 00:22:17,370
Let's just wait for backup.

304
00:22:17,370 --> 00:22:18,950
So we're going to stand here

305
00:22:19,000 --> 00:22:21,160
and watch as those people get killed?

306
00:22:22,540 --> 00:22:23,580
Hyun-seok...

307
00:22:27,540 --> 00:22:31,040
It looks like they're going towards that sign.

308
00:22:31,330 --> 00:22:32,830
Huh? The sign?

309
00:22:40,250 --> 00:22:41,700
We can lure them with these.

310
00:22:42,790 --> 00:22:43,660
Those?

311
00:22:44,160 --> 00:22:45,910
What will you do with them?

312
00:22:47,040 --> 00:22:48,790
Use this, my wheelchair!

313
00:22:48,830 --> 00:22:51,450
What are you talking about?

314
00:22:51,450 --> 00:22:53,660
What'll you do without it?

315
00:22:53,830 --> 00:22:55,040
Didn't you see earlier?

316
00:22:55,500 --> 00:22:58,580
If I'm going to get out, I won't be able to do it on this.

317
00:23:00,040 --> 00:23:02,540
We can't just let those people die.

318
00:23:12,450 --> 00:23:13,910
Fuck!

319
00:23:43,290 --> 00:23:44,200
Hurry!

320
00:23:45,790 --> 00:23:46,750
What?

321
00:23:46,750 --> 00:23:48,200
I can't. There's no way.

322
00:23:51,120 --> 00:23:52,660
Hey, don't go out there!

323
00:23:59,370 --> 00:24:00,330
This way!

324
00:24:01,500 --> 00:24:02,540
Hurry!

325
00:24:12,580 --> 00:24:13,790
Shut up, will you?

326
00:24:13,870 --> 00:24:14,660
Hurry!

327
00:24:29,370 --> 00:24:30,410
Why'd she do that?

328
00:24:31,620 --> 00:24:32,910
I'll go get her.

329
00:24:46,160 --> 00:24:47,580
Come, let's go.

330
00:24:47,950 --> 00:24:49,250
Come with me.

331
00:24:49,250 --> 00:24:51,950
You can do it. Let's go.

332
00:24:52,160 --> 00:24:54,200
Take my hand and go.

333
00:24:54,540 --> 00:24:56,450
Let's go, hurry.

334
00:25:01,500 --> 00:25:02,500
Kyu-seong!

335
00:25:13,950 --> 00:25:15,950
Come here, asshole!

336
00:25:18,910 --> 00:25:20,790
Get in, hurry!

337
00:26:18,200 --> 00:26:20,080
If I say our company's main business

338
00:26:20,120 --> 00:26:21,750
is collective intelligence...

339
00:26:21,830 --> 00:26:23,250
"Why is a bio company,

340
00:26:23,290 --> 00:26:26,450
rather than an IT company, studying that topic?"

341
00:26:26,950 --> 00:26:28,620
These fellows upgrade themselves

342
00:26:28,660 --> 00:26:30,250
through information exchange.

343
00:26:33,580 --> 00:26:36,500
Collective intelligence is a key force driving evolution.

344
00:27:17,080 --> 00:27:18,250
Kyu-seong!

345
00:27:18,910 --> 00:27:20,040
Hurry!

346
00:27:23,580 --> 00:27:24,660
No!

347
00:28:03,750 --> 00:28:06,410
This afternoon, the Doongwoori Building

348
00:28:06,410 --> 00:28:10,080
was locked down following an act of bio-terrorism.

349
00:28:10,330 --> 00:28:13,620
Health authorities designated the location a terrorism zone,

350
00:28:13,750 --> 00:28:16,450
and a full quarantine is in effect until an investigation...

351
00:28:16,450 --> 00:28:18,080
The Counterterrorism HQ says

352
00:28:18,120 --> 00:28:20,660
the virus in question is highly contagious

353
00:28:20,870 --> 00:28:22,790
and spreads extremely quickly.

354
00:28:22,870 --> 00:28:25,660
The Disease Control Agency is devoting all its resources

355
00:28:25,750 --> 00:28:26,750
to obtaining

356
00:28:26,750 --> 00:28:28,040
and researching possible vaccines.

357
00:28:28,080 --> 00:28:29,410
Meanwhile, unconfirmed rumors

358
00:28:29,500 --> 00:28:30,950
about this bio-terrorism attack

359
00:28:31,000 --> 00:28:33,410
are rapidly spreading online.

360
00:28:33,620 --> 00:28:35,160
SWAT deployment complete.

361
00:28:35,160 --> 00:28:37,160
Double barricade of Doongwoori Building in place.

362
00:28:37,330 --> 00:28:38,540
Visual confirmation.

363
00:28:52,620 --> 00:28:54,450
Hello, shoppers.

364
00:28:54,790 --> 00:28:58,750
Thank you for visiting Doongwoori Shopping Mall today.

365
00:28:59,540 --> 00:29:02,660
The shopping mall is now closing.

366
00:29:03,410 --> 00:29:06,700
We look forward to welcoming you tomorrow

367
00:29:06,750 --> 00:29:08,830
