368
00:29:09,620 --> 00:29:13,700
We wish you a comfortable and safe trip home.

369
00:29:13,950 --> 00:29:14,750
Thank you.

370
00:29:14,750 --> 00:29:16,870
Shit, the data's not working.

371
00:29:17,330 --> 00:29:18,950
I'm okay. Yeah.

372
00:29:20,290 --> 00:29:21,580
And you, Dad?

373
00:29:22,620 --> 00:29:24,540
My Dearest Daughter

374
00:29:25,250 --> 00:29:26,830
Really? Thank God...

375
00:29:32,120 --> 00:29:33,330
Dad!

376
00:29:34,700 --> 00:29:37,080
- Who are you? Where's my dad? - Did Dad answer?

377
00:29:38,500 --> 00:29:40,040
Ji-hye, go to Grandma for a sec.

378
00:29:40,450 --> 00:29:42,040
- Why? - Just for a sec.

379
00:29:42,120 --> 00:29:43,290
Mom, take her.

380
00:29:43,290 --> 00:29:45,290
Right, come with me for a minute.

381
00:29:51,540 --> 00:29:52,700
What...

382
00:29:55,080 --> 00:29:56,790
What about Kyu-seong?

383
00:30:00,370 --> 00:30:02,040
Did he go somewhere?

384
00:30:04,500 --> 00:30:05,830
Kyu-seong...

385
00:30:07,370 --> 00:30:10,370
saved some people, and then...

386
00:30:11,250 --> 00:30:12,410
Who...

387
00:30:13,000 --> 00:30:14,500
Who did he save?

388
00:30:14,950 --> 00:30:16,830
Everything just sucks!

389
00:30:17,160 --> 00:30:18,410
And then what?

390
00:30:19,040 --> 00:30:21,660
And then what happened?

391
00:30:29,250 --> 00:30:31,000
-Kyu-seong... - Dad!

392
00:30:39,120 --> 00:30:40,450
What are you talking about?

393
00:30:41,040 --> 00:30:43,410
You know how long I've been stuck here?

394
00:30:45,450 --> 00:30:48,160
You won't get infected unless you're bitten!

395
00:30:49,200 --> 00:30:50,370
What did you say?

396
00:30:53,750 --> 00:30:54,790
What's this?

397
00:30:55,080 --> 00:30:56,410
What do you think?

398
00:30:59,120 --> 00:31:00,450
You're going to carry me?

399
00:31:00,620 --> 00:31:02,250
Who else is going to carry you?

400
00:31:03,000 --> 00:31:04,790
Think of it as going camping.

401
00:31:05,120 --> 00:31:09,660
This is why you should think twice before helping others.

402
00:31:12,620 --> 00:31:14,080
Listen, Officer!

403
00:31:14,200 --> 00:31:16,540
There's a rescue team coming to get us, right?

404
00:31:18,700 --> 00:31:19,700
The rescue team

405
00:31:21,450 --> 00:31:22,660
can't come in here.

406
00:31:22,790 --> 00:31:23,580
What?

407
00:31:24,080 --> 00:31:25,540
What are you saying?

408
00:31:25,540 --> 00:31:27,120
We're all still alive!

409
00:31:27,290 --> 00:31:29,620
The news has reported that this virus

410
00:31:29,660 --> 00:31:31,410
is unbelievably contagious.

411
00:31:31,410 --> 00:31:33,620
Until an epidemiological analysis is done,

412
00:31:33,660 --> 00:31:35,500
this building is under quarantine.

413
00:31:35,580 --> 00:31:36,870
Then what about us?

414
00:31:36,870 --> 00:31:39,200
They're telling us to just die here?

415
00:31:39,290 --> 00:31:40,700
I don't wanna die...

416
00:31:40,700 --> 00:31:42,790
- I don't wanna die! - I'm going fucking crazy...

417
00:31:42,870 --> 00:31:45,450
Fuck, you know how much I pay this country in taxes?

418
00:31:45,450 --> 00:31:47,750
But they won't save me?

419
00:31:48,750 --> 00:31:52,700
There is one way that we can be saved.

420
00:31:53,080 --> 00:31:54,410
What's that?

421
00:31:54,500 --> 00:31:57,330
The man behind this attack, Suh Young-chul,

422
00:31:57,370 --> 00:31:59,790
says he's injected the vaccine into his own body.

423
00:31:59,870 --> 00:32:02,830
If we find him and bring him out, we can all be rescued.

424
00:32:02,950 --> 00:32:04,330
Where is he?

425
00:32:05,120 --> 00:32:08,370
It's said he attended the seminar in this building today,

426
00:32:08,580 --> 00:32:10,750
and there's no sign that he left.

427
00:32:11,790 --> 00:32:13,250
Suh Young-chul...

428
00:32:13,790 --> 00:32:16,450
came to meet Chains Bio CEO Kang Woo-cheol.

429
00:32:17,120 --> 00:32:17,950
That's right.

430
00:32:18,080 --> 00:32:18,830
How'd you know that?

431
00:32:18,830 --> 00:32:20,080
After the seminar,

432
00:32:20,120 --> 00:32:23,410
I saw him by Kang's VIP Room on the 3rd floor.

433
00:32:23,450 --> 00:32:25,580
You must be a professor.

434
00:32:25,700 --> 00:32:27,370
Then where did he go?

435
00:32:27,410 --> 00:32:30,700
I saw him follow Kang into the room.

436
00:32:30,910 --> 00:32:32,540
So what are we supposed to do?

437
00:32:32,870 --> 00:32:34,620
We can't even set foot outside this door!

438
00:32:34,620 --> 00:32:38,200
Go up to the 3rd floor? How can we make it there?

439
00:32:38,290 --> 00:32:39,410
Right...

440
00:32:39,950 --> 00:32:41,370
Those people out there

441
00:32:41,950 --> 00:32:44,750
seem to be evolving through information exchange.

442
00:32:45,120 --> 00:32:47,000
First they walked on all fours,

443
00:32:47,200 --> 00:32:48,910
and charged at signs.

444
00:32:49,540 --> 00:32:50,910
Now they walk on two feet

445
00:32:51,620 --> 00:32:53,660
and their ability to identify humans

446
00:32:53,660 --> 00:32:55,200
is slowly taking shape.

447
00:32:55,910 --> 00:32:57,700
They're exchanging info?

448
00:32:57,830 --> 00:33:00,040
How, by calling each other?

449
00:33:00,410 --> 00:33:02,540
Words are not the only way to communicate.

450
00:33:02,950 --> 00:33:04,250
Like fungi or mushrooms,

451
00:33:04,370 --> 00:33:05,750
many creatures other than humans

452
00:33:05,830 --> 00:33:07,450
have their own communication networks.

453
00:33:07,450 --> 00:33:11,200
For example, ants communicate by pheromones.

454
00:33:11,790 --> 00:33:13,910
And to expedite the exchange of pheromones,

455
00:33:14,000 --> 00:33:16,200
they create a communication network of mucus.

456
00:33:16,330 --> 00:33:19,870
So you're saying the infected people there,

457
00:33:20,290 --> 00:33:22,290
they're in a state resembling ants?

458
00:33:22,410 --> 00:33:24,540
If they have collective intelligence based

459
00:33:24,540 --> 00:33:25,830
on information exchange,

460
00:33:26,120 --> 00:33:28,660
perhaps we can input false information.

461
00:33:30,410 --> 00:33:32,620
What, they've turned into ants?

462
00:33:32,750 --> 00:33:35,790
So how do we give them false info?

463
00:33:36,330 --> 00:33:37,700
Show them fake news?

464
00:33:37,830 --> 00:33:40,040
Ants, too, often show errant behavior

465
00:33:40,080 --> 00:33:42,120
when receiving false information.

466
00:33:42,160 --> 00:33:44,750
For example, ant mills.

467
00:33:45,540 --> 00:33:47,330
Sometimes while exchanging pheromones,

468
00:33:47,540 --> 00:33:49,160
Ant Mill an error occurs.

469
00:33:49,290 --> 00:33:52,580
At such times, they form a giant circle in one spot

470
00:33:52,580 --> 00:33:55,750
and keep turning in place, unable to stop.

471
00:33:56,660 --> 00:33:58,000
Until they die.

472
00:33:58,290 --> 00:34:01,500
So how are we going to give them false information?

473
00:34:01,870 --> 00:34:05,830
If one of us went to them giving off a special odor,

474
00:34:06,120 --> 00:34:07,910
and the rest of us stood still,

475
00:34:07,910 --> 00:34:10,250
giving off a completely different odor,

476
00:34:10,410 --> 00:34:12,950
I don't think they'd be able to recognize us as humans.

477
00:34:13,540 --> 00:34:16,000
Then until they figure out their mistake,

478
00:34:16,330 --> 00:34:18,250
we can buy ourselves some time.

479
00:34:19,540 --> 00:34:21,500
Who's gonna do that?

480
00:34:21,950 --> 00:34:23,040
I'll do it.

481
00:34:23,950 --> 00:34:25,620
You'll fail, 100%.

482
00:34:26,250 --> 00:34:29,450
Look, how about someone more fit?

483
00:34:30,080 --> 00:34:31,540
This guy should do.

484
00:34:31,700 --> 00:34:32,830
I'll do it.

485
00:34:32,830 --> 00:34:34,500
I said I'll do it.

486
00:34:35,540 --> 00:34:37,660
You're looking down on me because of my age.

487
00:34:38,000 --> 00:34:39,450
But in my 20s, I won a gold medal

488
00:34:39,450 --> 00:34:41,330
in a national track and field competition.

489
00:34:41,330 --> 00:34:42,700
Yeah sure, you stay out.

490
00:34:44,080 --> 00:34:45,080
That hurts! Ouch!

491
00:34:47,870 --> 00:34:49,950
I coached track and field before retiring.

492
00:34:50,250 --> 00:34:53,620
Professor, tell me what I should do.

493
00:35:02,620 --> 00:35:04,330
Where should I put this?

494
00:35:04,330 --> 00:35:05,500
Here.

495
00:35:05,700 --> 00:35:07,040
- Here? - Yeah.

496
00:35:07,040 --> 00:35:09,620
I added you all to a group chat, so check it.

497
00:35:10,290 --> 00:35:13,910
If they're exchanging information, we should do it, too.

498
00:35:30,750 --> 00:35:33,160
Bring back this same perfume.

499
00:35:43,250 --> 00:35:45,750
Hey, you nutjobs!

500
00:35:46,330 --> 00:35:47,620
Come and get me!

501
00:37:11,620 --> 00:37:12,750
Hurry!

502
00:37:13,120 --> 00:37:14,750
Close the door!

503
00:37:16,410 --> 00:37:18,040
I got them. Here.

504
00:37:30,540 --> 00:37:30,660
Thal antifreeze, bring it here

505
00:37:30,660 --> 00:37:31,910
That antifreeze, bring it here!

506
00:37:31,910 --> 00:37:33,040
Antifreeze, okay!

507
00:37:37,750 --> 00:37:38,540
Here.

508
00:37:38,580 --> 00:37:39,660
That stinks!

509
00:37:39,790 --> 00:37:41,620
Why does this smell so strong?

510
00:38:02,000 --> 00:38:03,330
Ready? - Yeah.

511
00:40:13,330 --> 00:40:14,790
We can go now.

512
00:40:34,620 --> 00:40:35,410
Hurry up!

513
00:40:37,500 --> 00:40:38,700
Let's just go!

514
00:40:42,450 --> 00:40:43,580
What are you doing?

515
00:40:46,200 --> 00:40:48,040
Does anyone have a lighter?

516
00:41:18,120 --> 00:41:19,040
Hurry, run!

517
00:41:20,580 --> 00:41:21,700
Behind us!

518
00:41:43,120 --> 00:41:44,160
Run, quickly!

519
00:41:49,250 --> 00:41:50,290
Hold on tight.

520
00:42:10,620 --> 00:42:11,540
Look out!

521
00:42:50,120 --> 00:42:52,370
How did a world-renowned scientist

522
00:42:52,370 --> 00:42:55,080
become a terrorist threating the nation?

523
00:42:55,290 --> 00:42:58,290
Let's look into the background of Dr. Suh Young-chul.

524
00:42:58,410 --> 00:43:00,200
He was top-ranked at his university

525
00:43:00,250 --> 00:43:01,790
from entrance to graduation,

526
00:43:02,000 --> 00:43:05,290
and his graduation thesis "Biocomputing With Fungi"

527
00:43:05,450 --> 00:43:08,040
was published in the journal Science.

528
00:43:08,250 --> 00:43:10,662
For such a promising talent

529
00:43:10,662 --> 00:43:11,862
to suddenly commit terrorism

530
00:43:11,862 --> 00:43:13,062
and hold the nation hostage,

531
00:43:13,062 --> 00:43:15,105
it's quite hard to understand.

532
00:43:15,305 --> 00:43:16,148
Reporter Kim Seong-il,

533
00:43:16,148 --> 00:43:18,131
are there any notable details

534
00:43:18,131 --> 00:43:19,854
concerning Suh Young-chul ?

535
00:43:20,054 --> 00:43:23,550
Suh's father was a professor of Applied Biology

536
00:43:23,550 --> 00:43:25,820
at Seocheong University.

537
00:43:25,820 --> 00:43:26,952
PROF. SUH DENIES MISUSE OF RESEARCH FUNDS
While he was there,

538
00:43:26,952 --> 00:43:29,754
PROF. SUH DENIES MISUSE OF RESEARCH FUNDS
an anonymous tip led to an internal report

539
00:43:29,754 --> 00:43:32,119
on misuse of funds for his research lab

540
00:43:32,119 --> 00:43:34,161
and exploitation of student researchers,

541
00:43:34,161 --> 00:43:36,113
and this was widely covered in the press.

542
00:43:36,113 --> 00:43:38,281
Four weeks after the report

543
00:43:38,281 --> 00:43:40,956
Professor Suh chose to end his own life.

544
00:43:40,956 --> 00:43:43,230
Is there any link between this incident

545
00:43:43,230 --> 00:43:45,634
and Suh Young-chul's terrorist attack ?

546
00:43:45,834 --> 00:43:48,790
Could it be some sort of revenge?

547
00:43:49,120 --> 00:43:52,540
So far, Suh has not made any requests or demands,

548
00:43:52,580 --> 00:43:56,040
so it seems unlikely that the two incidents are related.

549
00:43:56,120 --> 00:43:58,660
At the moment, the government has not released

550
00:43:58,660 --> 00:44:00,540
any information about the attack.

551
00:44:02,620 --> 00:44:03,700
3rd Floor.

552
00:44:13,950 --> 00:44:14,950
No one here.

553
00:44:15,000 --> 00:44:15,830
Hurry!

554
00:44:45,080 --> 00:44:46,700
Suh Young-chul, you are under arrest

555
00:44:46,750 --> 00:44:48,910
for the Doongwoori Building terrorist attack.

556
00:44:49,160 --> 00:44:51,750
You have the right to an attorney,

557
00:44:51,750 --> 00:44:53,580
and the right to remain silent.

558
00:44:53,830 --> 00:44:56,790
Anything you say can and will be used against you in court...

559
00:44:56,790 --> 00:44:57,910
Nice to meet you.

560
00:44:58,330 --> 00:45:01,290
Using water to disrupt their communications network,

561
00:45:01,910 --> 00:45:03,790
that was your idea, Professor Kwon?

562
00:45:04,200 --> 00:45:04,950
What's this?

563
00:45:04,950 --> 00:45:06,370
You two know each other?

564
00:45:06,470 --> 00:45:07,660
But that was a mistake.

565
00:45:10,120 --> 00:45:12,160
Water evaporates quickly.

566
00:45:12,290 --> 00:45:15,040
If water mixes in the air with their network,

567
00:45:15,080 --> 00:45:16,410
won't it work faster?

568
00:45:17,080 --> 00:45:17,950
Forget it.

569
00:45:18,700 --> 00:45:19,790
What now?

570
00:45:20,290 --> 00:45:21,540
Is the rescue team coming?

571
00:45:22,200 --> 00:45:23,040
No.

572
00:45:23,410 --> 00:45:25,660
We have to meet the rescue team on the roof.

573
00:45:25,660 --> 00:45:26,160
What?

574
00:45:26,160 --> 00:45:28,290
The rescue team must not be exposed to the infected.

575
00:45:28,290 --> 00:45:32,080
We almost died coming here, now we have to go to the roof?

576
00:45:32,250 --> 00:45:35,200
Can't the rescue team come down and wipe them all out?

577
00:45:35,910 --> 00:45:37,410
Those people are patients.

578
00:45:37,750 --> 00:45:39,950
We've been ordered not to kill them without reason.

579
00:45:40,000 --> 00:45:41,580
What bullshit!

580
00:45:41,620 --> 00:45:43,290
Those monsters out there are patients?

581
00:45:43,790 --> 00:45:45,410
Do patients kill people?

582
00:45:46,540 --> 00:45:49,410
Damn it, I don't care if they're monsters or whatever.

583
00:45:49,620 --> 00:45:52,660
At any rate, if we can get him up to the roof,

584
00:45:52,790 --> 00:45:55,790
the rescue team will come. Then we can all survive.

585
00:45:56,000 --> 00:45:58,620
We just need to find a safe way to get there.

586
00:45:59,370 --> 00:46:01,040
Is there one?

587
00:46:01,200 --> 00:46:02,200
There is.

588
00:46:02,330 --> 00:46:06,080
There's a cargo elevator that most people don't know about.

589
00:46:07,620 --> 00:46:09,700
That seems safest.

590
00:46:10,370 --> 00:46:12,450
I think that security guard's right.

591
00:46:15,450 --> 00:46:18,160
Alright, let's give it a try.

592
00:46:18,540 --> 00:46:20,290
You take the lead.

593
00:46:24,290 --> 00:46:25,580
Let's go.

594
00:46:27,540 --> 00:46:28,580
You first.

595
00:46:33,370 --> 00:46:34,450
Professor Gong!

596
00:46:38,660 --> 00:46:41,290
You got here quickly.

597
00:46:41,450 --> 00:46:42,290
Yes.

598
00:46:43,660 --> 00:46:45,540
This was Suh Young-chul's research lab?

599
00:46:45,540 --> 00:46:46,200
Yeah.

600
00:46:46,370 --> 00:46:51,290
After leaving Chains Bio, it seems he kept researching here.

601
00:46:51,660 --> 00:46:52,620
Professor Joo!

602
00:46:52,700 --> 00:46:53,580
Yeah.

603
00:46:54,250 --> 00:46:57,290
Say hello. This is Myunghan University Biotechnology

604
00:46:57,330 --> 00:46:58,750
Professor Gong Sul-hee.

605
00:46:59,580 --> 00:47:02,160
These are professors Lee Hyeon-myeong and Jo Hyeon-mi.

606
00:47:02,160 --> 00:47:04,120
So the government has assembled

607
00:47:04,160 --> 00:47:06,200
this special investigative team.

608
00:47:06,200 --> 00:47:08,950
When the SWAT team goes in, we'll join them,

609
00:47:09,200 --> 00:47:10,830
so prepare yourself, Professor Gong.

610
00:47:10,830 --> 00:47:12,080
Understood.

611
00:47:12,830 --> 00:47:14,450
Alpha Team take the front door,

612
00:47:14,500 --> 00:47:16,200
Delta Team enter from the back.

613
00:47:33,620 --> 00:47:34,660
Shit...

614
00:47:35,330 --> 00:47:36,700
I'm gonna do it.

615
00:47:36,950 --> 00:47:38,160
I'm pushing it.

616
00:47:48,910 --> 00:47:50,250
Hurry up!

617
00:47:51,160 --> 00:47:52,370
Hurry!

618
00:47:53,370 --> 00:47:54,830
Close the door, quick!

619
00:48:00,370 --> 00:48:01,750
Going up.

620
00:48:04,040 --> 00:48:06,450
We'll be on the roof in 5 minutes.

621
00:48:09,750 --> 00:48:11,290
How old are you?

622
00:48:12,200 --> 00:48:14,120
You're in great shape for your age.

623
00:48:15,250 --> 00:48:17,200
The way you slid back there was so cool.

624
00:48:18,120 --> 00:48:19,580
You were so fast.

625
00:48:20,290 --> 00:48:21,160
Like this.

626
00:48:24,500 --> 00:48:25,410
The doors are opening.

627
00:48:43,200 --> 00:48:44,000
No!

628
00:49:08,370 --> 00:49:09,750
He got away!

629
00:49:11,200 --> 00:49:12,750
Who cares if he did?

630
00:49:13,250 --> 00:49:16,370
You really think that bastard's more important than us?

631
00:49:16,370 --> 00:49:18,080
That jerk is the vaccine.

632
00:49:18,290 --> 00:49:21,500
You saw it now. The infected didn't even touch him.

633
00:49:21,700 --> 00:49:23,580
We need to take that vaccine out with us!

634
00:49:23,700 --> 00:49:24,870
But...

635
00:49:25,450 --> 00:49:27,450
How are we supposed to bring him out?

636
00:49:27,450 --> 00:49:31,040
You saw how those monsters are swarming all over!

637
00:49:31,580 --> 00:49:34,040
How do we pull him out of there?

638
00:49:35,000 --> 00:49:36,080
The doors are opening.

639
00:49:45,830 --> 00:49:49,370
What? Are those bastards mimicking us?

640
00:49:54,830 --> 00:49:56,450
The doors are closing.

641
00:50:00,910 --> 00:50:02,450
What do we do now?

642
00:50:03,200 --> 00:50:04,450
-Hyun-seok. - Yeah?

643
00:50:04,500 --> 00:50:06,000
Is there a control room where

644
00:50:06,040 --> 00:50:07,950
you can see all the building's CCTVs?

645
00:50:07,950 --> 00:50:09,250
What? A control room?

646
00:50:09,580 --> 00:50:11,580
You should know, you're on the security team.

647
00:50:11,580 --> 00:50:12,160
Yeah.

648
00:50:12,160 --> 00:50:15,200
If we can watch all of the CCTVs,

649
00:50:15,290 --> 00:50:18,290
we can see where he's going in real time.

650
00:50:18,790 --> 00:50:20,290
The control room...

651
00:50:21,370 --> 00:50:23,250
is at the very end of Floor B2.

652
00:50:23,250 --> 00:50:24,830
B2! B2!

653
00:50:24,870 --> 00:50:27,700
For now, let's go there and look for Suh.

654
00:50:39,660 --> 00:50:40,950
Alpha, clear.

655
00:50:41,870 --> 00:50:43,200
Delta, clear.

656
00:50:44,000 --> 00:50:46,370
He's set up an entire lab here.

657
00:51:00,040 --> 00:51:01,870
You should see this over here.

658
00:51:18,040 --> 00:51:20,950
What is this? Are they all dead?

659
00:51:21,700 --> 00:51:23,000
They're alive.

660
00:51:29,830 --> 00:51:31,950
What experiment was he doing?

661
00:51:40,040 --> 00:51:42,290
Here! This one's been opened!

662
00:51:45,160 --> 00:51:46,290
Contact!

663
00:52:29,250 --> 00:52:30,540
SPECIAL OPERATION UNIT

664
00:52:37,370 --> 00:52:38,410
Attack!

665
00:52:39,080 --> 00:52:40,250
Return fire!

666
00:52:41,500 --> 00:52:42,410
Alpha down!

667
00:52:50,700 --> 00:52:52,000
Contact!

668
00:52:53,120 --> 00:52:55,080
Take her to safety!

669
00:53:33,540 --> 00:53:36,250
Targets have stopped moving. Clear, confirming.

670
00:53:36,620 --> 00:53:38,040
Clear, confirming.

671
00:53:42,700 --> 00:53:44,040
They've all stopped.

672
00:53:44,790 --> 00:53:46,250
Each defend your own zone.

673
00:53:46,290 --> 00:53:48,580
In case of danger, respond immediately.

674
00:54:35,870 --> 00:54:36,250
What's that?

675
00:54:37,120 --> 00:54:38,660
That's evolving?

676
00:54:39,910 --> 00:54:41,620
Where's the control room?

677
00:54:42,160 --> 00:54:43,200
That way.

678
00:54:43,250 --> 00:54:45,040
Okay, let's move quietly.

679
00:55:51,580 --> 00:55:53,080
Pull yourself together!

680
00:56:13,870 --> 00:56:15,080
Sit me down here.

681
00:56:15,370 --> 00:56:16,660
Close that.

682
00:56:22,870 --> 00:56:25,120
These are the main cameras.

683
00:56:25,750 --> 00:56:27,160
And for the auxiliary cams...

684
00:56:27,200 --> 00:56:28,120
CCTV.

685
00:56:30,250 --> 00:56:32,250
What floor did Suh get off on?

686
00:56:32,620 --> 00:56:33,580
8th floor?

687
00:56:33,910 --> 00:56:36,040
The 9th floor. I'll start looking there.

688
00:56:43,040 --> 00:56:45,160
You're in great shape for your age.

689
00:56:45,750 --> 00:56:47,790
The way you slid back there was so cool.

690
00:56:48,000 --> 00:56:49,450
You were so fast.

691
00:56:49,870 --> 00:56:51,830
How could Suh have known?

692
00:56:53,290 --> 00:56:54,750
The things he said in the elevator,

693
00:56:54,870 --> 00:56:56,870
as if he'd watched what we'd done.

694
00:56:59,040 --> 00:57:00,040
You're right.

695
00:57:00,950 --> 00:57:03,160
Is he watching CCTVs like us?

696
00:57:05,160 --> 00:57:09,080
If Suh can see through the eyes of the infected...

697
00:57:10,580 --> 00:57:11,620
Hold on, then...

698
00:57:12,580 --> 00:57:14,450
Whatever these monsters see,

699
00:57:15,160 --> 00:57:16,910
Suh can see the same thing?

700
00:57:17,120 --> 00:57:19,000
He sees the same thing? What the hell?

701
00:57:19,120 --> 00:57:20,120
I found him!

702
00:57:25,950 --> 00:57:27,830
Where's that bastard going?

703
00:57:52,330 --> 00:57:53,540
What's he doing?

704
00:57:58,040 --> 00:57:59,500
Where is he going?

705
00:58:01,580 --> 00:58:03,250
It seems he's searching for something.

706
00:58:03,750 --> 00:58:05,000
He stopped.

707
00:58:05,580 --> 00:58:06,950
Where is that?

708
00:58:07,290 --> 00:58:11,540
3rd Floor, Building A Hallway...

709
00:58:12,910 --> 00:58:14,040
Bro!

710
00:58:16,040 --> 00:58:18,830
You locked me up, so I had a hard time finding you.

711
00:58:24,790 --> 00:58:26,080
Oh, that's...

712
00:58:26,200 --> 00:58:28,040
CEO Kang Woo-cheol.

713
00:58:28,040 --> 00:58:29,000
Huh?

714
00:58:29,080 --> 00:58:31,160
The first person Suh met.

715
00:58:32,830 --> 00:58:35,910
He was probably the first infected.

716
00:58:43,040 --> 00:58:45,370
See, wasn't I right?

717
00:58:47,950 --> 00:58:51,160
I said you'd be my link to the new humanity.

718
00:58:51,580 --> 00:58:53,080
So hurry up and bite me.

719
00:59:04,450 --> 00:59:06,290
Wait, did he just bite him?

720
00:59:07,000 --> 00:59:07,790
What's happening to him?

721
00:59:22,450 --> 00:59:23,410
Look at them.

722
00:59:41,700 --> 00:59:43,370
I'm not sure what it is,

723
00:59:44,080 --> 00:59:45,660
but they must be receiving some

724
00:59:45,700 --> 00:59:47,540
completely new sort of information.

725
00:59:49,540 --> 00:59:53,450
What is it? Is it connected to Suh being bitten?

726
00:59:53,540 --> 00:59:55,290
I have no idea.

727
00:59:56,080 --> 00:59:59,160
Then how long will they be in this condition?

728
00:59:59,580 --> 01:00:01,410
Before, they were like that for several minutes.

729
01:00:01,410 --> 01:00:03,200
There's no way to know.

730
01:00:04,830 --> 01:00:06,540
Okay, this is our chance.

731
01:00:06,660 --> 01:00:09,450
While they're in that state, we should go get the vaccine.

732
01:00:09,870 --> 01:00:12,120
He's on the 3rd floor, it won't take long.

733
01:00:14,000 --> 01:00:16,660
I'll watch the CCTV from here

734
01:00:16,790 --> 01:00:19,290
and tell you where it's safe, through the group chat.

735
01:00:19,500 --> 01:00:21,950
What you?

736
01:00:24,120 --> 01:00:25,160
You're going to stay here?

737
01:00:25,160 --> 01:00:26,790
Get the vaccine and come back.

738
01:00:26,830 --> 01:00:29,040
Until then, I'll tell you where to go.

739
01:00:29,330 --> 01:00:31,290
How can I leave you behind?

740
01:00:31,870 --> 01:00:34,950
Listen to me. This is the safest way.

741
01:00:36,000 --> 01:00:37,160
Yes, let's do that.

742
01:00:37,250 --> 01:00:40,160
We don't know when they'll wake up, so let's hurry.

743
01:01:31,160 --> 01:01:33,660
Let's drag him to someplace safe.

744
01:01:39,620 --> 01:01:42,620
What's going on?

745
01:01:49,620 --> 01:01:50,540
Go, quick!

746
01:01:51,370 --> 01:01:52,910
Hurry! Run!

747
01:01:59,370 --> 01:02:00,830
Hurry! Get inside!

748
01:02:01,120 --> 01:02:02,160
Hurry!

749
01:02:06,200 --> 01:02:08,160
What is this freak doing?

750
01:02:10,870 --> 01:02:12,750
They're leaving.

751
01:02:43,500 --> 01:02:44,790
Go that way.

752
01:02:50,950 --> 01:02:52,200
This way, quickly!

753
01:03:13,950 --> 01:03:15,200
They're gone.

754
01:03:16,160 --> 01:03:17,830
What the hell did you do?

755
01:03:21,370 --> 01:03:25,040
Ah, did you only pretend to go out? You're smart.

756
01:03:25,950 --> 01:03:27,830
You think if you cover my eyes,

757
01:03:27,830 --> 01:03:30,290
you'll be able to get out of here alive?

758
01:03:30,370 --> 01:03:31,790
What's this freak yammering about?

759
01:03:32,700 --> 01:03:34,660
Since getting bitten by Kang Woo-cheol,

760
01:03:34,700 --> 01:03:36,790
it seems he can communicate with all of them.

761
01:03:37,200 --> 01:03:38,370
Wait, then...

762
01:03:38,830 --> 01:03:42,830
that means he can control all those monsters out there.

763
01:03:44,160 --> 01:03:46,330
Let's only communicate by texting.

764
01:03:46,370 --> 01:03:48,540
Don't let him see or hear anything.

765
01:04:02,620 --> 01:04:05,620
But didn't we file all of our reports already?

766
01:04:06,080 --> 01:04:08,290
Why are they calling us to the Counterterrorism HQ?

767
01:04:08,330 --> 01:04:10,580
We'll see when we get there.

768
01:04:35,120 --> 01:04:37,160
From office go straight to emergency exit.

769
01:04:38,080 --> 01:04:39,120
Up stairs to 4th floor, to machine room.

770
01:04:43,250 --> 01:04:44,410
Let's hurry.

771
01:05:07,580 --> 01:05:08,660
Wait a minute.

772
01:05:10,870 --> 01:05:13,910
We're going back to where we started.

773
01:05:15,000 --> 01:05:16,200
That's right. Why?

774
01:05:17,250 --> 01:05:18,700
We need to pick up my sister.

775
01:05:18,750 --> 01:05:21,910
But now we can get out with the vaccine.

776
01:05:22,250 --> 01:05:23,410
Oh, that's right.

777
01:05:23,660 --> 01:05:26,040
This way, there's an elevator to the roof.

778
01:05:26,200 --> 01:05:27,870
What's going on?

779
01:05:27,950 --> 01:05:28,910
SECURITY

780
01:05:28,910 --> 01:05:30,910
What are you suggesting here?

781
01:05:30,950 --> 01:05:33,080
But now we just need to go up.

782
01:05:33,120 --> 01:05:34,910
You expect us to go back to the control room?

783
01:06:10,250 --> 01:06:12,910
Control Room

784
01:06:28,500 --> 01:06:29,580
What the hell?

785
01:06:29,620 --> 01:06:30,410
Hey!

786
01:06:30,620 --> 01:06:32,580
What do you think you're doing?

787
01:06:33,080 --> 01:06:34,080
-You... What?

788
01:06:34,120 --> 01:06:35,080
What did you do?

789
01:06:35,120 --> 01:06:36,160
Stop it.

790
01:06:36,330 --> 01:06:38,040
Make it fucking stop!

791
01:06:40,040 --> 01:06:41,450
I can't let this bastard go.

792
01:06:41,500 --> 01:06:44,450
I'm taking him with me. You, follow me!

793
01:06:45,330 --> 01:06:46,330
Come on!

794
01:06:46,580 --> 01:06:48,040
What are you doing?

795
01:06:48,160 --> 01:06:49,450
Are you crazy?

796
01:06:50,120 --> 01:06:51,790
Don't touch that vaccine!

797
01:06:55,120 --> 01:06:58,330
I'm sorry, but give up on your sister.

798
01:06:59,160 --> 01:07:00,040
It's too late.

799
01:07:30,870 --> 01:07:33,040
Hyun-seok

800
01:07:36,580 --> 01:07:38,330
Until he brings back his sister,

801
01:07:38,410 --> 01:07:39,790
we're going to wait here.

802
01:07:39,830 --> 01:07:41,040
Got it?

803
01:07:55,120 --> 01:07:56,540
Everyone listen up.

804
01:07:56,700 --> 01:08:00,080
This vaccine here is more important than anyone.

805
01:08:00,500 --> 01:08:02,540
This is for the whole world, okay?

806
01:08:07,700 --> 01:08:11,040
If you want to live, lead the way.

807
01:08:12,160 --> 01:08:13,330
Now!

808
01:08:27,870 --> 01:08:29,120
Hyun-seok!

809
01:08:29,370 --> 01:08:31,790
Are you okay? I'm going to you now.

810
01:08:31,790 --> 01:08:34,540
Which way is safe to go?

811
01:08:36,700 --> 01:08:38,450
Which way should I go?

812
01:08:39,450 --> 01:08:40,790
Hyun-hee!

813
01:08:43,120 --> 01:08:43,500
Um...

814
01:08:44,040 --> 01:08:46,200
Keep going straight ahead,

815
01:08:46,250 --> 01:08:47,700
and turn right.

816
01:08:50,750 --> 01:08:51,830
Okay, then what?

817
01:08:53,500 --> 01:08:55,290
This time, go left.

818
01:09:00,370 --> 01:09:02,290
Go straight, then take the stairs on the right.

819
01:09:02,450 --> 01:09:04,250
No no, stairs on the left!

820
01:09:04,370 --> 01:09:05,290
The left?

821
01:09:05,370 --> 01:09:06,290
Here? Is this right?

822
01:09:06,290 --> 01:09:07,000
Yeah.

823
01:09:07,000 --> 01:09:08,540
Go up those.

824
01:09:10,580 --> 01:09:11,910
Okay, I'm here.

825
01:09:12,160 --> 01:09:14,290
Go out the door and take the elevator.

826
01:09:14,330 --> 01:09:16,120
Here it is!

827
01:09:16,700 --> 01:09:17,790
I'm here!

828
01:09:17,790 --> 01:09:19,040
Are you okay?

829
01:09:23,000 --> 01:09:24,660
Hyun-hee, you made a mistake,

830
01:09:24,700 --> 01:09:27,250
this elevator doesn't go to the basement.

831
01:09:27,580 --> 01:09:29,540
You're all set now. Press the 4th floor.

832
01:09:30,160 --> 01:09:32,330
The 4th floor? Get off there?

833
01:09:32,330 --> 01:09:33,450
Hyun-seok...

834
01:09:33,910 --> 01:09:34,830
Then what?

835
01:09:34,870 --> 01:09:36,700
Listen closely to what I say.

836
01:09:36,870 --> 01:09:38,080
From the 4th floor,

837
01:09:38,120 --> 01:09:41,040
go right until you see an emergency stairway.

838
01:09:41,290 --> 01:09:43,660
Climb up to the 7th floor.

